{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05004","headline":"绍隆寺 · 沈佺期","name":"绍隆寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾从释迦久，无上师涅盘。\n探道三十载，得道天南端。\n非胜适殊方，起諠归理难。\n放弃乃良缘，世虑不曾干。\n香界萦北渚，花龛隐南峦。\n危昂阶下石，演漾窗中澜。\n云盖看木秀，天空见藤盘。\n处俗勒宴坐，居贫业行坛。\n试将有漏躯，聊作无生观。\n了然究诸品，弥觉静者安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}